1
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:30,030
-Master.
-Master.

2
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:32,520
-Master.
-Master.

3
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:33,430
Master.

4
00:00:34,270 --> 00:00:34,800
Master.

5
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,010
The Young Master...

6
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:37,140
The Young Master...

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,530
Master, be careful.

8
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:48,200
What happened?

9
00:00:48,460 --> 00:00:49,540
Where is Yuanfan?

10
00:00:49,950 --> 00:00:50,700
Master,

11
00:00:50,720 --> 00:00:53,340
when I got here,
the Young Master was already gone.

12
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:55,450
All I found was the blood left on the bed.

13
00:00:55,450 --> 00:00:58,250
Get everyone in the Salt Gang
to look for my son!

14
00:00:58,390 --> 00:00:59,320
Yes, Master.

15
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:00,320
Wait!

16
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:01,800
Master.

17
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,750
Go find those sorcerers!

18
00:01:04,120 --> 00:01:05,840
If they dare to deceive me,

19
00:01:05,840 --> 00:01:08,000
I will skin them alive!

20
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:52,710
[A Prophet]

21
00:02:53,520 --> 00:02:55,610
[Episode 21]

22
00:02:58,590 --> 00:02:59,310
Master.

23
00:02:59,590 --> 00:03:00,560
They are back.

24
00:03:01,030 --> 00:03:03,160
They said they prepared a gift for you.

25
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:05,630
Come on in.

26
00:03:11,170 --> 00:03:11,900
Sect Master.

27
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,530
Sect Master.

28
00:03:16,300 --> 00:03:17,230
What an eyesore.

29
00:03:18,150 --> 00:03:19,550
Send him to the woodshed.

30
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:40,030
The weather is changing.

31
00:03:40,430 --> 00:03:41,890
I guess it's going to rain.

32
00:03:46,590 --> 00:03:48,000
In a few hours,

33
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:51,850
the Salt Gang will come out in full force.

34
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,210
There are hundreds of them,

35
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:56,320
and every one of them can fight.

36
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,680
Our Tianxiang Sect

37
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:59,570
is probably doomed this time.

38
00:04:02,030 --> 00:04:04,630
Why didn't you
just kill Shangguan Chengming?

39
00:04:04,750 --> 00:04:05,800
If you killed him,

40
00:04:06,280 --> 00:04:08,310
we could just end this.

41
00:04:11,870 --> 00:04:13,400
Cut the crap.

42
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,810
It's all because someone tried to use me
as a pawn.

43
00:04:18,430 --> 00:04:19,070
Really?

44
00:04:20,269 --> 00:04:21,070
Who?

45
00:04:22,060 --> 00:04:22,940
How did it go?

46
00:04:23,870 --> 00:04:25,190
I turned a killing trap

47
00:04:25,930 --> 00:04:27,390
into a money-making trap.

48
00:04:27,940 --> 00:04:29,210
I wonder if you like it.

49
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:30,610
I like making money.

50
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:32,200
Tell me about it.

51
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:33,510
Given Zhang Yinhua's tuberculosis,

52
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:35,240
he won't last more than a month.

53
00:04:35,280 --> 00:04:36,940
Even if we trap Li Ling's soul,

54
00:04:37,260 --> 00:04:38,920
when Zhang Yinhua ends up dead

55
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,430
and word gets out,

56
00:04:40,640 --> 00:04:42,300
how can others still trust us?

57
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,770
The double-sided trap
can last for 50 years,

58
00:04:44,770 --> 00:04:46,430
all thanks to your foresight—

59
00:04:47,159 --> 00:04:48,760
we do soul-trapping rituals

60
00:04:48,830 --> 00:04:50,560
for whoever can make a fortune.

61
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:51,510
Now,

62
00:04:51,530 --> 00:04:53,210
Zhang Yinhua is about to fall.

63
00:04:53,240 --> 00:04:55,360
You're only worried about

64
00:04:55,750 --> 00:04:57,680
how to keep this up after his death.

65
00:04:58,040 --> 00:04:58,990
Exactly.

66
00:04:59,430 --> 00:05:00,360
And then?

67
00:05:00,980 --> 00:05:03,760
Zhang Yuanfan will be
the future head of the Zhang family.

68
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:05,630
As long as he trusts us completely,

69
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:07,120
this trap will not end

70
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,830
for the next 50 years.

71
00:05:09,190 --> 00:05:10,560
Then what do you plan to do?

72
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:12,360
I hope you can do me a small favor.

73
00:05:17,430 --> 00:05:18,760
Arrange a killing trap?

74
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:20,920
No killing.

75
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,190
Master.

76
00:06:01,830 --> 00:06:02,750
You're here.

77
00:06:04,830 --> 00:06:06,430
I was just pondering over it.

78
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,680
I watched you grow up.

79
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,830
Among the Batous in our sect,

80
00:06:13,390 --> 00:06:15,240
you're the quickest-witted.

81
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,160
You can both figure out the bigger picture

82
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,800
and get small things done efficiently.

83
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:21,270
You've made me plenty of money

84
00:06:21,870 --> 00:06:24,950
and also caused me as much trouble.

85
00:06:27,480 --> 00:06:28,070
Master.

86
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:30,390
I was wrong.

87
00:06:32,470 --> 00:06:33,800
What did you do wrong?

88
00:06:34,390 --> 00:06:36,120
I shouldn't have saved Li Ling.

89
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,240
So you mean this.

90
00:06:42,920 --> 00:06:45,450
It seems that
you've saved more than just her.

91
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,970
Sect Master.

92
00:06:52,070 --> 00:06:53,630
Liu Xijiao and the others

93
00:06:54,070 --> 00:06:56,240
were all carefully trained
by the sect for years.

94
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,800
It would be such a pity for them
to die in the trap.

95
00:06:57,800 --> 00:06:58,920
How about we let them flee first?

96
00:06:58,920 --> 00:06:59,950
And when our sect

97
00:06:59,950 --> 00:07:01,600
needs them,

98
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,870
we can get them back to serve.

99
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:04,390
Also, please rest assured,

100
00:07:04,390 --> 00:07:05,870
they have all sworn on their lives

101
00:07:05,870 --> 00:07:07,430
never to reveal a word about it.

102
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:08,240
Look at you.

103
00:07:08,830 --> 00:07:09,830
Impressive.

104
00:07:10,510 --> 00:07:12,640
You're far-sighted and considerate.

105
00:07:13,120 --> 00:07:13,850
Sect Master,

106
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:16,780
I am willing to accept my punishment.

107
00:07:20,070 --> 00:07:22,270
Let me show you something interesting.

108
00:07:28,750 --> 00:07:30,950
You gave this to Liu Xijiao, didn't you?

109
00:07:33,270 --> 00:07:35,470
Seems like she doesn't need it anymore.

110
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:09,590
[Verdict from the Underworld]

111
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,360
Are you a human or a ghost?

112
00:08:48,910 --> 00:08:50,080
Where am I?

113
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:52,240
City God Temple,

114
00:08:52,610 --> 00:08:56,140
the first pass to the underworld.

115
00:08:56,230 --> 00:08:57,470
Stop fooling me!

116
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:58,790
I was sleeping at home.

117
00:08:58,790 --> 00:08:59,790
Then I woke up and ended up here.

118
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:00,790
How did I die?

119
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:01,790
Tell me!

120
00:09:03,270 --> 00:09:04,600
Everyone...

121
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:07,620
Says so.

122
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,440
Master,

123
00:09:20,010 --> 00:09:22,540
I ran into a female ghost
by chance yesterday.

124
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:24,390
She was trapped in the mortal world

125
00:09:24,390 --> 00:09:26,040
and begged me to take her back.

126
00:09:26,040 --> 00:09:28,170
Not until I took her back to this family

127
00:09:28,270 --> 00:09:29,510
did I realize

128
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:31,440
that her soul was trapped.

129
00:09:31,720 --> 00:09:33,910
I want to help the Zhang family
handle this,

130
00:09:33,910 --> 00:09:35,320
but my power is not strong enough.

131
00:09:35,320 --> 00:09:36,790
Master, please help me.

132
00:09:38,670 --> 00:09:39,960
This matter of the Zhang family

133
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:41,360
is not that simple.

134
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:43,120
I need to think it through.

135
00:09:44,030 --> 00:09:46,670
Yuanfan...

136
00:09:47,550 --> 00:09:50,080
I suffered so much...

137
00:09:51,870 --> 00:09:53,790
Yuanfan.

138
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:57,150
Yuanfan...

139
00:09:58,120 --> 00:09:59,510
You betrayed me.

140
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,150
Open the door! Help!

141
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:03,510
Yuanfan.

142
00:10:03,550 --> 00:10:04,150
Open the door! Help!

143
00:10:04,150 --> 00:10:05,550
You put me through this.

144
00:10:05,790 --> 00:10:07,120
Open the door!

145
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,200
Help!

146
00:10:09,720 --> 00:10:11,030
Yuanfan...

147
00:10:11,030 --> 00:10:12,320
Don't come over!

148
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,720
Open the door! Help!

149
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,670
Master, open the door!

150
00:10:15,670 --> 00:10:17,150
Help! Help!

151
00:10:17,150 --> 00:10:18,150
Master!

152
00:10:29,750 --> 00:10:31,510
Master, save me.

153
00:10:31,510 --> 00:10:33,670
I am Zhang Yuanfan, the Young Master
of the Zhang family

154
00:10:33,670 --> 00:10:34,630
you mentioned.

155
00:10:35,030 --> 00:10:36,480
Why are you here?

156
00:10:36,500 --> 00:10:37,950
I was sleeping at home.

157
00:10:37,980 --> 00:10:39,090
I woke up and ended up here!

158
00:10:39,090 --> 00:10:41,370
Yuanfan...

159
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:44,080
You can see Li Ling?

160
00:10:45,390 --> 00:10:46,850
Isn't she right out there?

161
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,800
Did you drink the talisman water

162
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:50,400
I gave your Zhang family?

163
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:52,630
I did drink it. I drank it all.

164
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:54,550
Why did you still end up dead
after drinking it?

165
00:10:54,550 --> 00:10:55,670
I don't know.

166
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:00,580
Did you pee after drinking

167
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:01,790
the talisman water?

168
00:11:08,150 --> 00:11:09,750
You can't pee that talisman water out!

169
00:11:09,750 --> 00:11:11,140
Peeing it out would lose its effect!

170
00:11:11,140 --> 00:11:11,940
Master,

171
00:11:12,570 --> 00:11:14,170
how could I hold my pee?

172
00:11:19,760 --> 00:11:22,080
You're already in the City God Temple now.

173
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:23,960
This is the first pass to the underworld.

174
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:25,080
Once the door opens,

175
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:26,300
take your verdict,

176
00:11:26,320 --> 00:11:27,510
remove your living registration,

177
00:11:27,510 --> 00:11:28,910
have it stamped with the City God's seal,

178
00:11:28,910 --> 00:11:30,710
and you can go to the underworld.

179
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:33,630
I'm really dead?

180
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:36,600
Yuanfan...

181
00:11:37,750 --> 00:11:39,200
Master, Master,

182
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:41,840
I beg you to take me back
to the mortal world.

183
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:42,790
As long as you take me back,

184
00:11:42,790 --> 00:11:43,910
my father will pay you

185
00:11:43,910 --> 00:11:44,960
as much as you want!

186
00:11:44,960 --> 00:11:46,480
My father never hesitates
to spend money for me.

187
00:11:46,480 --> 00:11:47,870
I am also a filial son.

188
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,600
I still need to take care of him.

189
00:11:49,600 --> 00:11:50,720
Master, I'm begging you.

190
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,360
Even if I take you back,

191
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,360
in a few days...

192
00:11:53,380 --> 00:11:55,310
Yuanfan...

193
00:11:56,160 --> 00:11:57,820
You will still come down here.

194
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,140
Could it be that
if I ascend to the mortal world,

195
00:12:01,140 --> 00:12:03,170
Li Ling can still
chase me there to kill me?

196
00:12:03,170 --> 00:12:04,740
You killed Li Ling and trapped her soul

197
00:12:04,740 --> 00:12:06,520
soon after she married into your family.

198
00:12:06,520 --> 00:12:08,420
There's no way
she won't cause you trouble.

199
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:09,900
I had no other choice.

200
00:12:10,450 --> 00:12:12,180
Given my father's poor health,

201
00:12:12,200 --> 00:12:13,600
he couldn't hold on for much longer.

202
00:12:13,600 --> 00:12:14,510
I just talked

203
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:17,390
to my master about this matter.

204
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:19,030
If he is willing to lend a hand,

205
00:12:19,030 --> 00:12:20,000
it'll take him

206
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:23,060
less than 7 days
to annihilate this evil ghost, Li Ling.

207
00:12:23,840 --> 00:12:24,630
However,

208
00:12:27,310 --> 00:12:28,670
Li Ling may not be the one

209
00:12:31,510 --> 00:12:33,240
trying to harm you, I'm afraid.

210
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:35,360
Then who else could it be?

211
00:12:35,940 --> 00:12:38,260
This person is very close to you.

212
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,120
Xiaomei?

213
00:12:44,750 --> 00:12:45,630
Dingxiang?

214
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,360
Fengxia?

215
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,200
Zhen?

216
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,630
It's your father,

217
00:12:50,650 --> 00:12:51,770
Zhang Yinhua.

218
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:55,400
He wanted to trap Li Ling's soul
to prolong his lifespan

219
00:12:55,400 --> 00:12:56,240
but failed.

220
00:12:56,410 --> 00:12:58,400
Even if he takes in another concubine now

221
00:12:58,400 --> 00:12:59,530
and treats her well,

222
00:12:59,790 --> 00:13:01,000
his health

223
00:13:01,020 --> 00:13:02,910
probably won't hold out until then.

224
00:13:02,910 --> 00:13:03,960
Therefore,

225
00:13:04,030 --> 00:13:06,960
he wants to trap someone
who is closest to him

226
00:13:07,410 --> 00:13:09,320
and will never betray him.

227
00:13:10,630 --> 00:13:12,270
I am his son.

228
00:13:14,010 --> 00:13:16,440
Our Zhang family has had only one heir
for 3 generations respectively.

229
00:13:16,440 --> 00:13:18,240
Would he end his own bloodline?

230
00:13:18,270 --> 00:13:19,240
Disciple,

231
00:13:19,910 --> 00:13:21,750
we are both cultivators.

232
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:24,720
Do not interfere
with other people's karma.

233
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,510
Just send him back to the mortal world.

234
00:13:27,650 --> 00:13:29,590
Whether it's a blessing or retribution

235
00:13:29,590 --> 00:13:30,880
depends on his fate.

236
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:33,950
Thank you, Master!

237
00:13:34,050 --> 00:13:35,250
Thank you, Master!

238
00:13:37,590 --> 00:13:38,400
Go!

239
00:13:54,530 --> 00:13:56,200
Li Ling isn't the only one

240
00:13:56,230 --> 00:13:58,360
trapped in your Zhang family's place.

241
00:13:58,450 --> 00:14:00,180
Do you know these people?

242
00:14:06,600 --> 00:14:07,480
Stepmother?

243
00:14:10,270 --> 00:14:11,400
Second Stepmother?

244
00:14:11,870 --> 00:14:13,000
And Concubine Liu?

245
00:14:16,630 --> 00:14:18,780
They can neither
return to the mortal world

246
00:14:18,780 --> 00:14:20,380
nor go to the underworld now.

247
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:23,640
They can only wander around here.

248
00:14:25,670 --> 00:14:26,910
Will they hurt me then?

249
00:14:26,910 --> 00:14:27,480
Xijiao?

250
00:14:27,480 --> 00:14:28,340
Yes, of course.

251
00:14:29,030 --> 00:14:30,830
They died for your Zhang family.

252
00:14:31,270 --> 00:14:32,360
If you break into the trap,

253
00:14:32,360 --> 00:14:33,480
we will kill you!

254
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:34,870
Go!

255
00:14:34,950 --> 00:14:36,160
Why harm me?

256
00:14:36,180 --> 00:14:37,760
My father trapped their souls, not me!

257
00:14:37,760 --> 00:14:38,890
That's why they say,

258
00:14:38,900 --> 00:14:40,530
"A son pays his father's debts."

259
00:14:40,530 --> 00:14:41,980
Isn't trapping souls meant
to protect our family?

260
00:14:41,980 --> 00:14:43,300
It protects your father.

261
00:14:43,300 --> 00:14:45,520
Otherwise, he would have died
20 years ago.

262
00:14:45,520 --> 00:14:47,330
He's got all the boons,

263
00:14:47,360 --> 00:14:48,670
while the banes

264
00:14:48,690 --> 00:14:50,050
are coming to you, of course.

265
00:14:50,050 --> 00:14:51,000
No way, Master.

266
00:14:51,510 --> 00:14:52,270
I beg you.

267
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:53,080
Please save me, Master.

268
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,010
I'm begging you!

269
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:10,760
Annihilate their souls,

270
00:15:13,060 --> 00:15:15,190
and you can return to the mortal world.

271
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:27,510
Yuanfan.

272
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:29,670
Yuanfan.

273
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:32,470
I am Concubine Liu,

274
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,200
Xijiao,

275
00:15:35,250 --> 00:15:36,480
Liu Xijiao!

276
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,000
Concubine Liu...

277
00:15:42,910 --> 00:15:43,960
I remember you.

278
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:45,260
Yuanfan...

279
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,320
Don't come closer.

280
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:47,580
Don't come any closer.

281
00:15:47,750 --> 00:15:48,550
Stay back.

282
00:15:50,720 --> 00:15:51,380
Yuanfan...

283
00:15:52,670 --> 00:15:53,150
Wait.

284
00:15:54,930 --> 00:15:55,690
Disciple,

285
00:15:56,270 --> 00:15:57,270
let him go.

286
00:16:02,510 --> 00:16:05,310
If my father could use you
to prolong his lifespan,

287
00:16:06,130 --> 00:16:07,560
why can't I?

288
00:16:10,510 --> 00:16:11,480
I want to live.

289
00:16:11,670 --> 00:16:12,670
I want to survive!

290
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:14,510
A son pays his father's debts.

291
00:16:14,510 --> 00:16:16,320
He's got all the boons,

292
00:16:16,320 --> 00:16:17,150
while the banes...

293
00:16:17,150 --> 00:16:17,550
Yuanfan...

294
00:16:17,550 --> 00:16:19,150
Are coming to you, of course.

295
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:19,840
Go to hell.

296
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:22,200
All of you, go to hell!

297
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:24,840
No!

298
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:25,790
No!

299
00:16:49,890 --> 00:16:51,040
These three people

300
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:53,790
are my gift in return to you.

301
00:16:54,640 --> 00:16:56,920
Jiang Feiyan let these female Abaos go.

302
00:16:57,270 --> 00:16:58,790
You know the sect rules.

303
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:00,840
I've been merciful enough.

304
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:03,330
I had Chief Batou drug them.

305
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:04,970
Although they've become deranged,

306
00:17:04,970 --> 00:17:06,930
they can still live for a while.

307
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:09,369
If they weren't of use to your trap,

308
00:17:09,920 --> 00:17:11,250
they'd already be dead.

309
00:17:11,550 --> 00:17:12,960
They are not pawns!

310
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:13,920
They are human!

311
00:17:14,589 --> 00:17:16,440
Do you care so little about human lives?

312
00:17:16,440 --> 00:17:18,450
Shout a bit louder, and he will wake up,

313
00:17:18,450 --> 00:17:19,990
and she would have died for nothing.

314
00:17:19,990 --> 00:17:21,450
Trampling on human lives—

315
00:17:22,869 --> 00:17:25,640
is this what the Tianxiang Sect calls
"upholding justice"?

316
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:27,240
"Upholding justice."

317
00:17:28,109 --> 00:17:29,700
Let me tell you what justice is.

318
00:17:29,700 --> 00:17:31,030
Whoever holds the power

319
00:17:31,110 --> 00:17:32,110
is justice.

320
00:17:32,310 --> 00:17:35,160
Whether I talk sense or nonsense,

321
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:38,140
as long as people like him all believe it,

322
00:17:38,350 --> 00:17:39,750
that is justice.

323
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:41,440
I know you can't kill anyone.

324
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,790
You can't do it.

325
00:17:43,030 --> 00:17:44,640
But you must pass this test,

326
00:17:44,750 --> 00:17:46,480
so I had to give you a push.

327
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:49,030
Didn't we agree not to kill?

328
00:17:51,790 --> 00:17:52,920
Making money

329
00:17:54,350 --> 00:17:55,720
is a bloody business.

330
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:10,020
When did Liu Xijiao

331
00:18:10,830 --> 00:18:12,000
come back?

332
00:18:12,030 --> 00:18:13,550
This person has nothing to do
with you anymore.

333
00:18:13,550 --> 00:18:14,760
Don't ask about her again.

334
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:16,360
According to the sect rules,

335
00:18:16,570 --> 00:18:19,000
anyone who wants to leave
must take 3 cuts and 6 stabs.

336
00:18:19,000 --> 00:18:20,270
Today, in front of the Sect Master,

337
00:18:20,270 --> 00:18:21,260
how could they still...

338
00:18:21,260 --> 00:18:23,120
Our Sect Master is soft-hearted.

339
00:18:24,750 --> 00:18:26,720
He gave the girls a chance

340
00:18:27,590 --> 00:18:29,350
to come back and help set a trap.

341
00:18:31,400 --> 00:18:32,200
That's right.

342
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:33,640
Yes.

343
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,270
After this trap is done,

344
00:18:35,270 --> 00:18:36,750
they will be allowed to leave.

345
00:18:36,750 --> 00:18:37,670
Listen,

346
00:18:37,700 --> 00:18:38,750
this girl will no longer

347
00:18:38,750 --> 00:18:40,470
be a member of our sect.

348
00:18:40,500 --> 00:18:42,930
You and she were just
not meant to be together in this life,

349
00:18:42,930 --> 00:18:43,720
got it?

350
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:53,240
Let's go.

351
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:02,940
Glad that she left.

352
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:05,470
Good to know she left.

353
00:19:33,030 --> 00:19:34,160
Knock as you please.

354
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:35,480
This one is

355
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:37,630
made of genuine nanmu wood,

356
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,290
with a 9-inches-thick base

357
00:19:39,290 --> 00:19:40,490
and flawless planks.

358
00:19:41,840 --> 00:19:44,670
It can withstand any amount of knocking.

359
00:19:44,970 --> 00:19:45,770
I knew

360
00:19:45,800 --> 00:19:47,720
you would definitely show mercy

361
00:19:47,740 --> 00:19:49,460
and come buy a coffin for that girl.

362
00:19:49,460 --> 00:19:50,020
See?

363
00:19:50,270 --> 00:19:51,670
I specifically kept the best one

364
00:19:51,670 --> 00:19:52,430
just for you.

365
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:53,740
It won't cost much.

366
00:19:54,790 --> 00:19:55,920
Just 3 gold bars.

367
00:19:55,960 --> 00:19:57,240
I'll take this coffin.

368
00:19:57,880 --> 00:19:59,000
I'll pay you

369
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:00,700
when the trap is done.

370
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,510
You really thought

371
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:04,640
those female Abaos could escape?

372
00:20:04,640 --> 00:20:05,750
You know what?

373
00:20:05,960 --> 00:20:07,960
The Sect Master has been watching you
all along.

374
00:20:07,960 --> 00:20:09,790
The Sect Master has already

375
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:12,000
seen through your thoughts.

376
00:20:13,350 --> 00:20:14,720
I just don't get it.

377
00:20:15,750 --> 00:20:17,640
If you want to do good deeds,

378
00:20:18,160 --> 00:20:20,480
you can go be a teacher
and join a revolution.

379
00:20:20,480 --> 00:20:21,110
Or at least,

380
00:20:21,110 --> 00:20:22,590
you can go become a monk in the mountains.

381
00:20:22,590 --> 00:20:24,590
Why did you join our Tianxiang Sect?

382
00:20:26,160 --> 00:20:27,890
I just feel sorry for that girl.

383
00:20:28,880 --> 00:20:30,210
What's wrong with that?

384
00:20:33,070 --> 00:20:34,200
Feel sorry for her?

385
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:37,270
In these times,

386
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:39,750
the world is awash with pitiful people.

387
00:20:39,750 --> 00:20:41,480
For us swindlers,

388
00:20:41,790 --> 00:20:42,750
if we can

389
00:20:42,920 --> 00:20:45,240
end up lying in a coffin like this,

390
00:20:45,830 --> 00:20:47,830
that will be the greatest blessing.

391
00:21:22,110 --> 00:21:23,720
How bold you are.

392
00:21:23,870 --> 00:21:25,200
How dare you come again?

393
00:21:25,590 --> 00:21:26,590
Where is my son?

394
00:21:26,750 --> 00:21:27,590
I've brought

395
00:21:28,130 --> 00:21:29,890
your son back to you.

396
00:21:33,960 --> 00:21:34,750
Yuanfan.

397
00:21:36,510 --> 00:21:37,350
Yuanfan!

398
00:21:37,350 --> 00:21:39,640
Don't worry, he's fine.

399
00:21:45,480 --> 00:21:47,590
Be careful.

400
00:21:48,030 --> 00:21:49,200
Young Master.

401
00:21:49,720 --> 00:21:50,480
Yuanfan.

402
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:51,800
My boy.

403
00:21:52,200 --> 00:21:52,720
My boy?

404
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,240
Li Ling...

405
00:21:57,590 --> 00:21:58,750
Li Ling...

406
00:21:58,750 --> 00:22:00,510
Li Ling wants to kill me...

407
00:22:02,510 --> 00:22:03,510
Don't let her come near.

408
00:22:03,510 --> 00:22:05,110
Don't let her come any closer!

409
00:22:05,110 --> 00:22:06,240
Keep her away from me.

410
00:22:06,240 --> 00:22:08,330
Your son just came back
from the underworld.

411
00:22:08,330 --> 00:22:11,090
His soul fragments
haven't fully returned yet.

412
00:22:12,260 --> 00:22:12,980
Yuanfan.

413
00:22:13,000 --> 00:22:13,930
Don't be afraid.

414
00:22:14,110 --> 00:22:15,110
I am here with you.

415
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:15,790
Tell me

416
00:22:16,000 --> 00:22:16,960
what happened.

417
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:20,270
Master!

418
00:22:20,590 --> 00:22:21,480
Master!

419
00:22:22,310 --> 00:22:23,070
Master!

420
00:22:23,440 --> 00:22:24,160
Master, I beg you.

421
00:22:24,160 --> 00:22:25,560
You must save me, Master!

422
00:22:25,790 --> 00:22:27,270
I don't want to go back there again!

423
00:22:27,270 --> 00:22:28,270
Master...

424
00:22:28,400 --> 00:22:30,920
You may take your son
back to his room to rest first.

425
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:32,400
Master, I'm scared...

426
00:22:32,510 --> 00:22:33,110
Master...

427
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:33,960
Young Master.

428
00:22:33,960 --> 00:22:35,440
Please get up, Young Master.

429
00:22:35,440 --> 00:22:36,440
You're back home.

430
00:22:36,790 --> 00:22:37,350
Save me.

431
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:38,400
Save me, Master.

432
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:39,880
Master!

433
00:22:47,000 --> 00:22:47,880
Sir,

434
00:22:49,640 --> 00:22:51,790
you have done a great favor
for our Zhang family.

435
00:22:51,790 --> 00:22:53,890
This is a gift to show our appreciation.

436
00:22:53,890 --> 00:22:54,780
Sir,

437
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,510
I must say something in the first place.

438
00:22:57,510 --> 00:22:58,510
This matter

439
00:22:58,960 --> 00:22:59,820
is not over yet.

440
00:23:00,110 --> 00:23:01,440
Li Ling's soul

441
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:03,570
is only temporarily suppressed by me.

442
00:23:03,570 --> 00:23:06,070
It will take one week
to completely annihilate it.

443
00:23:06,070 --> 00:23:08,830
Be careful.
Li Ling will come again this week.

444
00:23:13,770 --> 00:23:15,160
She will come again?

445
00:23:15,180 --> 00:23:16,710
She will not only come again

446
00:23:16,840 --> 00:23:19,020
but also take advantage
of your son's weak condition

447
00:23:19,020 --> 00:23:20,470
to occupy his body.

448
00:23:20,490 --> 00:23:22,890
Therefore, you must not mention
the matter of Li Ling

449
00:23:22,890 --> 00:23:24,490
and the soul trapping again.

450
00:23:24,880 --> 00:23:25,880
If you bring it up,

451
00:23:26,150 --> 00:23:28,150
you'll be summoning Li Ling's soul.

452
00:23:28,270 --> 00:23:29,790
Before possessing your son's body,

453
00:23:29,790 --> 00:23:31,640
Li Ling will bind him with evil energy,

454
00:23:31,640 --> 00:23:33,310
leaving scratch marks on his body.

455
00:23:33,310 --> 00:23:36,270
When that happens,
you must keep your son's soul

456
00:23:36,320 --> 00:23:38,470
and not give Li Ling any opportunity.

457
00:23:42,240 --> 00:23:42,640
Tie him up!

458
00:23:42,640 --> 00:23:43,610
What are you doing?

459
00:23:43,610 --> 00:23:45,130
What? What are you doing?

460
00:23:45,430 --> 00:23:46,320
Let me go!

461
00:23:46,480 --> 00:23:48,590
You'll kill yourself scratching like that!

462
00:23:48,590 --> 00:23:50,790
I'm itchy, so I scratch!
What's wrong with that?

463
00:23:50,790 --> 00:23:52,680
Father, tell them to let me go!

464
00:23:53,030 --> 00:23:54,130
I'm itchier when you tie me,

465
00:23:54,130 --> 00:23:54,960
Father!

466
00:23:55,030 --> 00:23:55,680
Hurry up!

467
00:23:55,680 --> 00:23:56,510
I won't scratch anymore.

468
00:23:56,510 --> 00:23:58,000
Just tell them to let me go,

469
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:58,880
Father!

470
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:01,160
Let me go!

471
00:24:06,110 --> 00:24:06,640
Master.

472
00:24:06,960 --> 00:24:07,590
Master.

473
00:24:09,350 --> 00:24:11,030
How is he doing now?

474
00:24:11,130 --> 00:24:12,520
As you ordered,

475
00:24:12,630 --> 00:24:14,290
we fed him the talisman water,

476
00:24:14,510 --> 00:24:15,840
and he's been sleeping.

477
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:18,920
The Young Master's got
ghost scratch marks all over his body,

478
00:24:18,920 --> 00:24:19,920
even on his back

479
00:24:19,920 --> 00:24:22,240
where he can't reach himself!

480
00:24:22,390 --> 00:24:23,780
It must be

481
00:24:24,550 --> 00:24:26,310
Li Ling coming for him.

482
00:24:28,490 --> 00:24:29,620
Have a seat, Master.

483
00:24:32,080 --> 00:24:33,720
I've been taking a turn

484
00:24:33,750 --> 00:24:35,550
for the worse day by day.

485
00:24:36,750 --> 00:24:38,990
Where is the girl I asked you to find?

486
00:24:39,440 --> 00:24:40,510
I'm still working on it.

487
00:24:40,510 --> 00:24:42,040
Why is it so hard to find one?

488
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:44,590
With my wealth, I can't even find a wife?

489
00:24:44,590 --> 00:24:45,110
Go

490
00:24:45,480 --> 00:24:47,880
buy one from those poor people
who are selling

491
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:48,880
their daughters.

492
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:49,690
Understood.

493
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:21,720
Who is it?

494
00:25:50,670 --> 00:25:51,320
Who?

495
00:26:41,440 --> 00:26:42,370
Don't come over!

496
00:26:42,920 --> 00:26:44,180
Don't come any closer!

497
00:26:45,720 --> 00:26:46,440
Stay back!

498
00:26:47,030 --> 00:26:47,920
Back!

499
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:49,640
I have money!

500
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:51,000
I can give you everything!

501
00:26:51,000 --> 00:26:51,830
What are you all doing?

502
00:26:51,830 --> 00:26:52,310
Make way!

503
00:26:52,310 --> 00:26:53,570
Don't come any closer!

504
00:26:53,890 --> 00:26:55,090
-Master.
-Master.

505
00:26:55,200 --> 00:26:56,130
Don't come over!

506
00:26:56,680 --> 00:26:57,590
Stay back!

507
00:26:59,150 --> 00:26:59,980
I have money!

508
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,800
I can give you everything I have!

509
00:27:02,070 --> 00:27:02,640
Please spare me!

510
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:03,240
Open the door.

511
00:27:03,240 --> 00:27:04,170
Don't come over!

512
00:27:13,160 --> 00:27:13,750
Yuanfan.

513
00:27:16,090 --> 00:27:16,730
Yuanfan!

514
00:27:39,310 --> 00:27:40,110
Li Ling...

515
00:27:41,720 --> 00:27:42,980
Li Ling has come for me.

516
00:27:47,200 --> 00:27:52,180
[Zhang Residence]

517
00:27:57,440 --> 00:27:57,960
What?

518
00:27:58,160 --> 00:27:59,290
Does it disgust you?

519
00:27:59,590 --> 00:28:00,680
You asked me to use eel blood,

520
00:28:00,680 --> 00:28:02,160
and now I stink of it.

521
00:28:03,270 --> 00:28:04,930
Eel blood is the most pungent.

522
00:28:05,070 --> 00:28:06,740
Only by attracting bats
to hit the door this way

523
00:28:06,740 --> 00:28:09,200
could we make it
sound like a ghost knocking.

524
00:28:11,900 --> 00:28:13,500
Guess who I saw the other day?

525
00:28:15,200 --> 00:28:15,640
Who?

526
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:17,640
Liu Xijiao!

527
00:28:19,350 --> 00:28:20,160
Sect Master

528
00:28:20,160 --> 00:28:21,640
didn't stoop to their level.

529
00:28:21,640 --> 00:28:23,040
He had them help set a trap

530
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,720
and then let them go.

531
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,920
Sect Master is such a nice person,

532
00:28:27,920 --> 00:28:29,120
like a living Buddha.

533
00:28:46,550 --> 00:28:47,750
Young Master...

534
00:28:55,710 --> 00:28:56,510
I have already

535
00:28:56,750 --> 00:28:58,240
chosen the person.

536
00:28:58,670 --> 00:28:59,840
In a few days,

537
00:29:00,350 --> 00:29:01,200
you

538
00:29:01,310 --> 00:29:03,680
can perform the soul-trapping ritual.

539
00:29:04,790 --> 00:29:05,750
I've been watching

540
00:29:05,750 --> 00:29:07,210
this child for a long time.

541
00:29:07,240 --> 00:29:09,350
The child and the father live together

542
00:29:09,350 --> 00:29:10,200
in poverty.

543
00:29:10,720 --> 00:29:12,980
As long as I pay the family
a little money,

544
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,880
the child will definitely follow me...

545
00:29:14,880 --> 00:29:16,680
I think we should just forget it.

546
00:29:16,980 --> 00:29:18,870
It's a very filial child,

547
00:29:18,890 --> 00:29:19,920
young

548
00:29:19,950 --> 00:29:21,540
and promising.

549
00:29:22,610 --> 00:29:24,280
Are you really going to trap
this child's soul?

550
00:29:24,280 --> 00:29:26,010
The child's mother died early.

551
00:29:26,710 --> 00:29:29,490
What's wrong with the child
doing something for the father?

552
00:29:29,490 --> 00:29:31,750
It's a perfect choice for soul trapping.

553
00:29:34,490 --> 00:29:35,640
Close the door.

554
00:29:42,050 --> 00:29:44,790
Li Ling may not be the one
trying to harm you, I'm afraid.

555
00:29:44,790 --> 00:29:46,000
Then who else could it be?

556
00:29:46,000 --> 00:29:47,960
It's your father, Zhang Yinhua.

557
00:29:48,340 --> 00:29:51,020
He can only trap someone
who is closest to him

558
00:29:51,590 --> 00:29:53,350
and will never betray him.

559
00:30:03,920 --> 00:30:05,180
It protects your father.

560
00:30:05,180 --> 00:30:07,480
Otherwise, he would have died
20 years ago.

561
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:09,240
He's got all the boons,

562
00:30:09,260 --> 00:30:10,120
while the banes

563
00:30:10,590 --> 00:30:12,190
are coming to you, of course.

564
00:30:42,790 --> 00:30:44,720
Where's the handprint on the door?

565
00:30:44,830 --> 00:30:46,440
Where's the handprint on the door?

566
00:30:46,440 --> 00:30:47,750
What handprint?

567
00:30:47,940 --> 00:30:49,580
Li Ling came last night.

568
00:30:51,200 --> 00:30:52,480
The handprint she left

569
00:30:53,110 --> 00:30:54,240
is gone!

570
00:30:54,480 --> 00:30:55,510
It's gone!

571
00:31:00,920 --> 00:31:01,680
Yuanfan.

572
00:31:04,070 --> 00:31:05,070
Look at me.

573
00:31:08,760 --> 00:31:10,280
Do you love me?

574
00:31:17,640 --> 00:31:18,510
My boy, tell me,

575
00:31:20,200 --> 00:31:21,350
do you love me?

576
00:31:21,460 --> 00:31:22,780
Then tell me,

577
00:31:25,110 --> 00:31:26,770
what's that water vat outside

578
00:31:27,330 --> 00:31:28,770
for?

579
00:31:32,170 --> 00:31:33,620
Isn't that used

580
00:31:34,040 --> 00:31:37,000
to make your favorite pickles?

581
00:31:37,680 --> 00:31:38,570
No!

582
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:40,440
No...

583
00:31:40,720 --> 00:31:42,440
You use it to trap souls.

584
00:31:42,830 --> 00:31:43,590
Trap souls.

585
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:44,640
Son,

586
00:31:45,060 --> 00:31:46,830
I don't know what you're talking about.

587
00:31:46,830 --> 00:31:47,980
Trap what?

588
00:31:48,110 --> 00:31:51,020
I don't get what you mean.

589
00:31:53,550 --> 00:31:55,080
Do you still remember this?

590
00:31:55,720 --> 00:31:57,460
When you trapped Li Ling's soul,

591
00:31:57,460 --> 00:31:58,390
her body...

592
00:31:58,730 --> 00:32:00,450
her body was covered

593
00:32:00,830 --> 00:32:02,480
with these marks scratched by ghosts.

594
00:32:02,480 --> 00:32:03,550
What did you say?

595
00:32:04,880 --> 00:32:05,750
Who?

596
00:32:06,020 --> 00:32:07,070
My wife...

597
00:32:07,090 --> 00:32:08,650
My wife, Li Ling!

598
00:32:08,680 --> 00:32:10,010
Didn't you trap her soul

599
00:32:10,200 --> 00:32:11,460
to prolong your lifespan?

600
00:32:11,460 --> 00:32:13,990
I don't know the person
you're talking about.

601
00:32:18,880 --> 00:32:20,350
You're not going to live much longer.

602
00:32:20,350 --> 00:32:21,550
You need to find someone.

603
00:32:21,550 --> 00:32:23,080
You can't find anyone else,

604
00:32:23,310 --> 00:32:24,970
so you want to seal my soul now.

605
00:32:25,320 --> 00:32:27,050
You want to trap my soul, right?

606
00:32:29,000 --> 00:32:31,060
What nonsense are you talking about?

607
00:32:31,830 --> 00:32:32,470
Yuanfan,

608
00:32:33,270 --> 00:32:34,720
I love you!

609
00:32:35,590 --> 00:32:37,590
Do you love me?

610
00:32:37,960 --> 00:32:39,760
You've never asked if I love you.

611
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:42,950
Why the sudden question?

612
00:32:42,950 --> 00:32:44,360
Why are you asking me all of a sudden now?

613
00:32:44,360 --> 00:32:46,430
I just want you to say it!

614
00:32:46,550 --> 00:32:47,600
Do you love me?

615
00:32:48,070 --> 00:32:49,550
Do you love me?

616
00:32:49,640 --> 00:32:51,440
Do you love me?

617
00:32:53,510 --> 00:32:54,240
I love you...

618
00:32:55,510 --> 00:32:57,030
I love you to death!

619
00:33:01,000 --> 00:33:02,370
You must keep your son's soul

620
00:33:02,370 --> 00:33:04,300
before Li Ling possesses his body.

621
00:33:04,470 --> 00:33:06,270
When you are alone with your son,

622
00:33:06,400 --> 00:33:07,030
ask him

623
00:33:07,720 --> 00:33:08,580
if he loves you.

624
00:33:09,000 --> 00:33:11,130
You must stare him straight in the eyes

625
00:33:11,270 --> 00:33:13,470
and make sure he answers this question.

626
00:33:17,430 --> 00:33:19,400
[Yunhe Temple]

627
00:33:22,880 --> 00:33:23,550
Master.

628
00:33:24,200 --> 00:33:25,000
Sir,

629
00:33:26,660 --> 00:33:28,070
why are you doing this?

630
00:33:28,120 --> 00:33:28,950
I want to...

631
00:33:33,070 --> 00:33:34,800
I want to trap my father's soul!

632
00:33:40,720 --> 00:33:41,480
Did I hear you wrong,

633
00:33:41,480 --> 00:33:42,940
or are you out of your mind?

634
00:33:43,830 --> 00:33:45,830
You want to trap your father's soul?

635
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:50,460
That old man is already
in the late stages of tuberculosis.

636
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:53,730
Yet he wants to use me
to prolong his lifespan.

637
00:33:54,590 --> 00:33:55,990
I know he's turned to you.

638
00:33:56,030 --> 00:33:57,960
You must have received
a lot of rewards from him.

639
00:33:57,960 --> 00:33:59,110
But it doesn't matter!

640
00:33:59,110 --> 00:34:00,310
Whatever he pays you,

641
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:01,960
I'll double it.

642
00:34:02,790 --> 00:34:03,480
Good?

643
00:34:03,930 --> 00:34:05,200
He is your father.

644
00:34:06,680 --> 00:34:07,600
Are you sure about this?

645
00:34:07,600 --> 00:34:10,070
There's no father in the world
who doesn't care about his son.

646
00:34:10,070 --> 00:34:11,280
Is he even human?

647
00:34:12,400 --> 00:34:14,230
He always says my mother died early,

648
00:34:14,230 --> 00:34:16,030
and it wasn't easy
for him to raise me alone.

649
00:34:16,030 --> 00:34:18,489
That's because he trapped
my mother's soul.

650
00:34:18,550 --> 00:34:19,440
Therefore,

651
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:20,880
trapping him

652
00:34:21,280 --> 00:34:22,719
is me upholding justice!

653
00:34:23,360 --> 00:34:25,159
I'll give you 3 more opium shops.

654
00:34:25,630 --> 00:34:26,830
Let's do it together.

655
00:34:27,320 --> 00:34:29,120
Let's uphold justice together.

656
00:34:32,110 --> 00:34:33,570
"Disasters and blessings

657
00:34:33,670 --> 00:34:35,000
are brought by humans."

658
00:34:35,150 --> 00:34:36,409
You must think through

659
00:34:38,960 --> 00:34:40,500
the consequences of this.

660
00:34:46,330 --> 00:34:47,790
I have thought it through.

661
00:34:50,280 --> 00:34:51,510
I'll kill him

662
00:34:53,230 --> 00:34:55,090
and get my hands covered in blood.

663
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:57,030
And I'm leaving

664
00:34:59,030 --> 00:35:00,360
the rest to you, Master.

665
00:35:03,840 --> 00:35:04,590
Master!

666
00:35:06,960 --> 00:35:07,890
Young Master...

667
00:35:07,920 --> 00:35:08,670
The cellar!

668
00:35:11,260 --> 00:35:12,480
Stop that brat now!

669
00:35:13,490 --> 00:35:14,740
Be careful, Master.

670
00:35:21,150 --> 00:35:21,920
Master.

671
00:35:22,590 --> 00:35:23,050
Master.

672
00:35:29,230 --> 00:35:30,000
Yuanfan.

673
00:35:31,370 --> 00:35:32,080
My boy?

674
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:33,550
Yuanfan!

675
00:36:01,440 --> 00:36:02,240
Young Master.

676
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:08,080
Young Master.

677
00:36:10,840 --> 00:36:11,640
Young Master.

678
00:36:14,640 --> 00:36:15,230
Murder!

679
00:36:15,320 --> 00:36:16,240
Murder!

680
00:36:27,050 --> 00:36:27,900
Yuanfan,

681
00:36:28,710 --> 00:36:29,110
my boy.

682
00:36:30,710 --> 00:36:31,780
I am Zhang Yinhua.

683
00:36:32,470 --> 00:36:33,550
I am Zhang Yinhua.

684
00:36:34,070 --> 00:36:35,030
Zhang Yinhua!

685
00:36:36,550 --> 00:36:37,610
What are you doing?

686
00:36:37,880 --> 00:36:38,810
Don't come over!

687
00:36:39,820 --> 00:36:41,260
I am your father!

688
00:36:42,230 --> 00:36:43,760
And you still want to kill me

689
00:36:45,760 --> 00:36:46,690
and trap my soul?

690
00:36:46,960 --> 00:36:48,400
What nonsense are you talking about?

691
00:36:48,400 --> 00:36:50,360
Stop playing dumb with me!

692
00:36:53,820 --> 00:36:54,840
What is this?

693
00:37:10,760 --> 00:37:12,220
And what are these things?

694
00:37:12,290 --> 00:37:14,040
Tell me, what are these?

695
00:37:19,440 --> 00:37:20,000
Father,

696
00:37:20,760 --> 00:37:21,480
tell me.

697
00:37:26,320 --> 00:37:27,190
Do you love me?

698
00:37:30,610 --> 00:37:31,980
Do you love me?

699
00:37:35,170 --> 00:37:37,120
Yes, I love you...

700
00:37:39,440 --> 00:37:40,840
The entire Zhang family

701
00:37:42,320 --> 00:37:43,230
will be mine.

702
00:37:44,320 --> 00:37:45,320
Since you love me,

703
00:37:46,920 --> 00:37:47,630
Father,

704
00:37:52,070 --> 00:37:53,440
just stay here

705
00:37:53,980 --> 00:37:56,140
and bless me with wealth and glory!

706
00:38:14,740 --> 00:38:16,230
♪ The lantern waits for one ♪

707
00:38:16,250 --> 00:38:17,730
♪ Who won't return ♪

708
00:38:17,760 --> 00:38:20,730
♪ My eyes hide a sorrow beyond words ♪

709
00:38:20,930 --> 00:38:22,990
♪ I ask for too much ♪

710
00:38:23,020 --> 00:38:24,900
♪ Then blame fate ♪

711
00:38:25,150 --> 00:38:27,650
♪ One step, one trap, one fall ♪

712
00:38:27,670 --> 00:38:30,880
♪ Greed turns into a chain
to trap the old love ♪

713
00:38:31,120 --> 00:38:34,400
♪ Play with fire, yet people's foolishness
will never burn away ♪

714
00:38:34,420 --> 00:38:38,150
♪ Who pretends to be a saint
in front of others ♪

715
00:38:38,170 --> 00:38:43,400
♪ Yet turns around
and wallows in the mundane world? ♪

716
00:38:48,000 --> 00:38:54,070
♪ My greed burns away who I am ♪

717
00:38:54,740 --> 00:39:00,200
♪ My anger clouds what I hold dear ♪

718
00:39:01,240 --> 00:39:07,560
♪ My obsession keeps me
from turning back ♪

719
00:39:07,580 --> 00:39:13,810
♪ I keep my heart closed ♪

720
00:39:21,150 --> 00:39:22,760
Let me go!

721
00:39:50,000 --> 00:39:51,960
You're making me
clean up your mess again, huh?

722
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:53,000
This case

723
00:39:53,280 --> 00:39:56,210
is enough for you to claim credit
with Director Wang.

724
00:39:57,700 --> 00:39:59,490
You may be nosy,

725
00:40:00,670 --> 00:40:01,960
but you're always doing

726
00:40:01,960 --> 00:40:03,320
righteous things.

727
00:40:03,570 --> 00:40:04,760
Why does a person like you

728
00:40:04,760 --> 00:40:05,440
have to

729
00:40:05,440 --> 00:40:07,170
stay with a bunch of swindlers?

730
00:40:08,070 --> 00:40:10,030
You've also diligently
worked on various cases

731
00:40:10,030 --> 00:40:11,560
in Yucheng, Detective Guo.

732
00:40:11,760 --> 00:40:13,280
Why does a person like you

733
00:40:14,150 --> 00:40:15,070
have to

734
00:40:15,400 --> 00:40:16,880
work for Director Wang?

735
00:40:17,390 --> 00:40:18,750
Drink tea as you please,

736
00:40:19,080 --> 00:40:20,480
but don't talk nonsense.

737
00:40:31,580 --> 00:40:34,550
[Tomb of Liu Xijiao]

738
00:40:34,800 --> 00:40:35,840
What's this?

739
00:40:38,950 --> 00:40:40,150
Didn't Xijiao leave?

740
00:40:44,070 --> 00:40:44,710
Liang,

741
00:40:45,440 --> 00:40:46,550
There's something I never knew

742
00:40:46,550 --> 00:40:47,630
how to tell you.

743
00:40:48,760 --> 00:40:49,800
At this point...

744
00:40:52,110 --> 00:40:54,040
I think I should tell you the truth.

745
00:40:54,230 --> 00:40:55,280
Because I don't want to be

746
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:56,740
a swindler in front of you.

747
00:40:58,840 --> 00:41:01,240
Liu Xijiao wasn't let go
by the Sect Master.

748
00:41:02,720 --> 00:41:04,450
The Sect Master got her killed.

749
00:41:04,670 --> 00:41:06,190
I buried her with my own hands.

750
00:41:06,190 --> 00:41:06,880
No way.

751
00:41:07,400 --> 00:41:08,630
The Sect Master
wouldn't kill the innocent.

752
00:41:08,630 --> 00:41:09,960
The Sect Master wouldn't kill Liu Xijiao!

753
00:41:09,960 --> 00:41:10,590
Liang.

754
00:41:10,800 --> 00:41:12,150
I said, it's impossible!

755
00:41:12,150 --> 00:41:13,480
The Sect Master treats us gofers so well!

756
00:41:13,480 --> 00:41:14,840
Stop lying to yourself.

757
00:41:15,360 --> 00:41:17,090
We experienced
the Soul-Trapping Game together.

758
00:41:17,090 --> 00:41:18,610
If we hadn't saved Li Ling,

759
00:41:20,190 --> 00:41:21,590
she would be dead as well.

760
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:26,030
The Sect Master has drowned
so many innocent girls

761
00:41:26,030 --> 00:41:27,070
in water vats

762
00:41:27,230 --> 00:41:28,110
just to continue

763
00:41:28,110 --> 00:41:29,970
his scam that has lasted 50 years.

764
00:41:47,960 --> 00:41:48,890
Eight years ago,

765
00:41:49,800 --> 00:41:52,000
the Sect Master set a trap in Jianghuai,

766
00:41:52,290 --> 00:41:54,600
ruining a family of the Wangs.

767
00:41:55,350 --> 00:41:56,080
At that time,

768
00:41:56,600 --> 00:41:59,130
only one person
in the whole family survived.

769
00:41:59,170 --> 00:42:01,800
He saw the bodies
of his younger brother and younger sister

770
00:42:01,800 --> 00:42:03,240
floating on the Nanxi River.

771
00:42:02,310 --> 00:42:08,890
♪ Under the old city wall,
that year the rain fell gently ♪

772
00:42:04,360 --> 00:42:05,720
That only survivor

773
00:42:07,550 --> 00:42:08,480
was me.

774
00:42:08,960 --> 00:42:10,630
At that time, I only wanted to die,

775
00:42:09,470 --> 00:42:15,420
♪ You walked by with an umbrella,
saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

776
00:42:11,280 --> 00:42:12,550
but I met Jin Buhuan.

777
00:42:13,710 --> 00:42:16,110
He told me the truth
behind the whole thing.

778
00:42:16,490 --> 00:42:22,800
♪ Later, a blade lay hidden
within a smile ♪

779
00:42:16,960 --> 00:42:17,960
Since then,

780
00:42:18,880 --> 00:42:20,760
I've only had one thought in my mind.

781
00:42:20,760 --> 00:42:22,420
As long as I can get revenge...

782
00:42:24,050 --> 00:42:31,300
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark
cut deep into my heart ♪

783
00:42:24,420 --> 00:42:26,150
I'm willing to learn anything.

784
00:42:31,720 --> 00:42:37,330
♪ You know full well how weak I am ♪

785
00:42:32,870 --> 00:42:33,660
Liang,

786
00:42:34,710 --> 00:42:37,110
about what kind of person
the Sect Master is

787
00:42:37,860 --> 00:42:40,050
♪ Yet you always turn around ♪

788
00:42:38,440 --> 00:42:40,250
and what kind of organization
the Tianxiang Sect is,

789
00:42:40,070 --> 00:42:45,860
♪ Shielding me from
harsh words and cold daggers ♪

790
00:42:40,870 --> 00:42:42,730
you have to see clearly on your own

791
00:42:45,960 --> 00:42:47,280
and think it through.

792
00:42:47,000 --> 00:42:50,460
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

793
00:42:50,510 --> 00:42:53,410
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

794
00:42:54,070 --> 00:42:57,570
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

795
00:42:57,600 --> 00:43:00,160
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

796
00:43:00,970 --> 00:43:04,510
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

797
00:43:04,540 --> 00:43:07,230
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

798
00:43:07,930 --> 00:43:11,320
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

799
00:43:11,340 --> 00:43:16,250
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

800
00:43:12,550 --> 00:43:13,670
I'm sorry...

801
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:15,590
Xijiao...

802
00:43:16,550 --> 00:43:18,150
I was too stupid.

803
00:43:19,630 --> 00:43:21,440
I didn't protect you well.

804
00:43:22,230 --> 00:43:24,230
I lost you.

805
00:43:41,050 --> 00:43:41,860
Xijiao,

806
00:43:42,320 --> 00:43:43,230
trust me.

807
00:43:43,700 --> 00:43:49,470
♪ By the window,
flowers withers as time passes ♪

808
00:43:44,380 --> 00:43:46,440
I will definitely avenge your death.

809
00:43:47,070 --> 00:43:48,150
Sect Master...

810
00:43:50,550 --> 00:43:56,270
♪ You lean on the door with a smile
and ask how long it takes to let go ♪

811
00:43:51,670 --> 00:43:52,760
Just you wait.

812
00:43:55,210 --> 00:43:56,740
[Jiulongpo Station, Yucheng]

813
00:43:57,140 --> 00:44:04,060
♪ The blade draws near
yet misses every time ♪

814
00:44:01,550 --> 00:44:03,030
Not all girls

815
00:44:03,590 --> 00:44:04,760
can get away clean

816
00:44:05,150 --> 00:44:11,380
♪ The moment you do it,
all that's left is a trembling embrace ♪

817
00:44:05,440 --> 00:44:06,590
like Li Ling.

818
00:44:07,230 --> 00:44:08,440
She sold her house

819
00:44:08,920 --> 00:44:10,720
and can stay in Pangzhou for now.

820
00:44:10,920 --> 00:44:11,800
In the future,

821
00:44:12,240 --> 00:44:15,350
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

822
00:44:12,550 --> 00:44:13,950
she can also go to Nanyang

823
00:44:14,030 --> 00:44:15,070
for peace.

824
00:44:15,470 --> 00:44:17,430
Just one boat ticket to Nanyang

825
00:44:15,590 --> 00:44:18,090
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

826
00:44:18,650 --> 00:44:22,450
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

827
00:44:19,280 --> 00:44:21,480
costs enough to buy a girl from our sect.

828
00:44:22,030 --> 00:44:23,360
I've explained everything

829
00:44:22,690 --> 00:44:25,350
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

830
00:44:24,150 --> 00:44:25,610
about Liu Xijiao to Liang.

831
00:44:25,880 --> 00:44:29,100
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

832
00:44:26,510 --> 00:44:28,370
He'll eventually know the truth,

833
00:44:29,320 --> 00:44:31,850
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

834
00:44:29,400 --> 00:44:30,840
and he deserves to know

835
00:44:31,230 --> 00:44:32,290
what kind of person

836
00:44:32,680 --> 00:44:36,290
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

837
00:44:33,190 --> 00:44:34,720
on earth the Sect Master is.

838
00:44:35,320 --> 00:44:36,600
Did the Sect Master cause you any trouble

839
00:44:36,600 --> 00:44:40,540
♪ I'll hold back and let you go ♪

840
00:44:38,230 --> 00:44:39,560
for saving those girls?

841
00:44:39,800 --> 00:44:40,710
Not yet.

842
00:44:41,760 --> 00:44:43,690
I guess he has more ruthless tricks

843
00:44:44,110 --> 00:44:45,360
waiting for me.

844
00:44:46,070 --> 00:44:47,280
If possible,

845
00:44:47,670 --> 00:44:48,590
I'd rather

846
00:44:51,080 --> 00:44:52,370
die by your hands.

847
00:44:53,430 --> 00:44:54,160
With me here,

848
00:44:57,810 --> 00:44:59,040
you'll be fine.

849
00:45:09,500 --> 00:45:11,750
[In the next episode]

850
00:45:11,960 --> 00:45:14,220
The Fifth Batou and Shangguan Chengming

851
00:45:14,320 --> 00:45:16,140
saved Paozi from the trap.

852
00:45:16,160 --> 00:45:17,280
They were also the ones

853
00:45:17,280 --> 00:45:18,340
who broke the trap.

854
00:45:18,760 --> 00:45:21,220
Breaking the trap
means breaking the rules.

855
00:45:22,420 --> 00:45:24,480
Now you're talking to me about rules?

856
00:45:24,590 --> 00:45:25,510
So what?

